# Cloud Build context is intentionally limited to vision and backend contract inputs.
*

!services/
!services/vision/
!services/vision/**
!contracts/
!contracts/**
!infra/
!infra/cloudbuild.vision.yaml
!infra/cloudrun.vision.yaml
!tools/
!tools/backend/
!tools/backend/**

# Never upload local credentials, caches, generated Flutter output, design assets,
# or user-provided screenshots even when they are added under an included tree.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.venv/
**/.uv/
**/.cache/
**/build/
**/node_modules/
**/Demo_Screenshots/
**/EcoLoop_AI_Figma_Design_Artifacts/
**/assets/mock/
